# Phase 5 (CTRLO-WIDER): the family of p5-ctrlo-wider-diff-fam in an answer
# (the inline transcript, 118 cells of text a row), in a prompt, on Ctrl-O
# and in the composer. The answer: the short line, then four paragraphs that
# reach a row's last cell by the count (U+261D, U+2E3A, `a` U+FE0F, U+E0002
# then `z`, each before `TAIL5678`) and one whose first row by the count is
# four U+261D, 110 `w` and `TAIL`, with 20 `w` and `END` after it -- two rows
# by fx's count and by xfx's named form alike, at 120 columns and at 140, so
# no row below it moves and no Ctrl-O page starts on another row. Then the
# short line typed (the composer), sent as a prompt (its card), Ctrl-O over
# both turns; then four U+261D, 110 `w` and `TAIL`, a new line and 117 `w`,
# U+261D and `TAIL` typed (the composer at the margin), the screen widened to
# 140 columns (fx writes the document again at the new width, xfx leaves its
# rows to the terminal), and Ctrl-O again (its rows laid out again at the new
# width). `cursor` says where the caret is; `wire` keeps every byte written,
# for a replay on libghostty-vt
# (.prd/tui-phase5/receipts/ctrlo-wider/replay_ghostty.c).
gateway p5-ctrlo-wider-inline-fam-turns.json
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
keep
until shown Run /help for commands
type go
wait 1
key Enter
until shown END
until gone Generating (
snap answer
wire answer
type fam ☝ ⸺ 🖐 x󠀂y a️b ­️c ﾠ️d ￰️e ⁥f end
until shown ┃ fam
snap composer
cursor composer
wire composer
key Enter
until shown Spare.
until gone Generating (
snap prompt
wire prompt
key C-o
until shown full detail
snap ctrlo
wire ctrlo
key C-o
until gone full detail
type ☝☝☝☝wwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwTAIL
key C-j
type wwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwww☝TAIL
until shown ┃ TAIL
snap margin
cursor margin
wire margin
resize 40x140
wait 2
snap resized
wire resized
key C-o
until shown full detail
snap ctrlo-resized
wire ctrlo-resized
key C-o
until gone full detail
gwlog
